.TH VOXEL-BOROUGHS 6 "August 2026" "Voxel Boroughs" "Games"
.SH NAME
voxel-boroughs \- open-source voxel city-building game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B voxel-boroughs
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Voxel Boroughs is a standalone city builder derived from the Luanti 5.17 engine.
.SH OPTIONS
Run
.B voxel-boroughs --help
for the inherited engine command-line options.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.voxel-boroughs
contains Linux user worlds, settings, screenshots, and caches.
.SH COPYRIGHT
Engine code is LGPL-2.1-or-later. Original game code is MIT. Original assets are CC BY 4.0. See the bundled notices for attribution.

